rture from B), refusal-message pointers merge.py:120 + jsonl_store.py:689/755, RECEIPT_ORDER_FOLD.md R2/R3; JsonlStore engine class UNTOUCHED; planned frozen last-0.x sidecar keeps its own copy (e1: no sidecar exists yet — future home named, nothing to fence). Q6 generate_lens grows key axis against the atoms primitive; existing ts vectors become ByKey('ts') family BYTE-IDENTICAL (normative, loops-go reads them); new families: non-ts key + adversarial missing-K/mixed-type/id-tiebreak; checkpoint dispatch tests enumerate Ordering variants — Arrival licenses checkpoint+replay_from suffix, ByKey cold-folds. Q7 Rule 17 scan scope = slice C0 first commit: git ls-files selection + docs/scratch exclusion, shrink-only. KEEP (NON-NEGOTIABLE): Spec.replay_from, VertexHandle checkpoint machinery, benchmark arms, Rule 17 semantics, ArrivalStore write path (except CAS coordinate), legacy families. Commit seams C0-C5, C1→{C2,C4,C5}. GATE items 1-7 in proposal incl. main-checkout full suite post-merge.
