   870	    def genesis(self) -> dict:
   871	        """The record at ordinal 0, validated as a genesis.
   872	
   873	        A file whose first record is not a valid genesis is not an arrival
   874	        log and opening it refuses. There is no inference of identity from
   875	        content: the singleton heuristic that guessed a store's lineage from
   876	        its rows was a hijack vector, and here the hazard dissolves rather
   877	        than being defended against, because position 0 is structural.
   878	
   879	        Routes through the content-keyed memo (:meth:`_genesis_from`), so a
   880	        ceremony that asks for the genesis twice pays for one validation.
