   988	
   989	        :meth:`walk` and :meth:`_walk_tail` differ only in where they start
   990	        and how the lineage is established; every rule applied to a record
   991	        is the same, and it lives here so it cannot be added to one path and
   992	        forgotten on the other. It was duplicated for two review rounds, and
   993	        both rounds had to patch the same check twice.
   994	
   995	        ``lineage`` is None only for a walk from ordinal 0, where the
   996	        genesis names it. A resume passes the genesis's lineage in, so the
   997	        anchor cannot decide what the rest of the file is checked against.
   998	
