  1133	           not stale, it is a mark about a different file, and pointing it
  1134	           here is meaningless.
  1135	        2. The offset is an integer inside ``0..size``. A negative offset is
  1136	           not a seek position to try, it is metadata that cannot be true.
  1137	        3. It lands strictly on a record boundary.
