   320	Five fields, no more. This is field-for-field the existing content commitment
   321	— `{kind, ts, observer, origin, payload}` (`sqlite_store.py:254-273`) — with
   322	`kind`→`k`, `ts`→`at`, `payload`→`body`. The renames are the arrival
