   713	def recover_declaration_update(intent: Path | str) -> RecoveryOutcome:
   714	    """Classify and (when safe) finish an interrupted declaration update.
   715	
   716	    Idempotent: a ``safe-to-finish`` run completes the file replace and
   717	    removes the intent; a second run over the same path answers
   718	    ``already-applied`` (no pending intent). ``conflict`` leaves the intent
   719	    AND the file exactly as found — nothing is ever clobbered on that path.
