   106	    NEVER decided by the offset marker alone. That marker lives inside the
   107	    very sqlite file this audit exists to judge, so trusting it would let an
   108	    attacker rewind one integer to move a divergence out of scope (rewind the
   109	    marker below an edited interior row and every other L1 check still
