   420	
   421	What this document’s rulings hand the sidecar spec.
   422	
   423	Class (a) is a re-read. The JSONL-canonical flagship store is already in
   424	 the arrival format’s line grammar; migration re-encodes nothing — it prepends
   425	 the genesis ceremony and carries lines verbatim.
