The branch history confirms there is no slice-D commit or `arrival-sliceD` gate directory. I also found a separate ceremony issue worth isolating: the public declaration CAS token is declaration-scoped as ruled, but the final append guard may still compare the whole arrival head. I’m tracing that transaction path now because it determines whether this is a silent two-scope violation or merely an internal race guard.
